id: pm-lint-ci-v2
title: Split quick PR checks from exhaustive local CI
description: "Apply Fleet CI v2; companion pm-cli-website-dyhg. Preserve required checks and every original gate, full defaults and unchanged four-dimensional coverage. Release caller rollout #85 remains separate."
type: Task
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags[2]: ci,performance
created_at: "2026-11-15T16:17:52.504Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-15T16:24:02.423Z"
assignee: codex-sol
claim_principal: codex-sol
author: codex-sol
comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-15T16:19:39.457Z",codex-sol,"Required checks remain test (22), test (26), codeql; no CodeQL path filters. Main run 42818809945 queue-inclusive walls 80m49s/94m14s, npm gates 6m16s/5m43s (22/26), Bun 26 repeated 5m43s. Slowest model 191-194s and packed acceptance ~97s. Deep retains npm/Bun on both Node 22/26 as requested (old PR Bun ran only on 26). Packed acceptance already proves real Bun/bunx installs and reads the README/docs package list, so docs-only CI retains it and Bun setup. Identity/private-path policy runs on every PR leg. Release caller #85 and verifier scripts remain untouched."
  "2026-11-15T16:24:02.423Z",codex-sol,"Typecheck/lint passed; linked static checks passed in 21.313s. Strict YAML and per-job timeout checks passed; actionlint unavailable. Quick fuzz counts use actual emitted+refused totals with an exact generated count assertion; full depth keeps >50 outcomes of each kind. Harness scales are finite/positive and rounded before test bodies or direct-child spawns; no product budget assertions are scaled. Initial local conflict CLI check failed during overlapping dist builds; focused rerun passed 1/1 in 15.485s after builds completed, with root cause awaiting the original error detail. Bounded quick coverage and packed acceptance remain running. Pushing early without waiting for GitHub CI."
